─ Keyboard shortcuts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Compose                                 Session
  /                     Commands          ?          Keyboard shortcuts
  @                     Mention files     ←          Dashboard (empty or
                        and plugins                  read-only input)
  $                     Select a skill    Esc Esc    Open rewind checkpoints
  Enter                 Send message      esc        Interrupt task
  Shift+Enter / Ctrl+J  New line          shift+tab  Cycle task mode
  Ctrl+R                Search input      shift+↓    Decrease thinking effort
                        history           shift+↑    Increase thinking effort
  ctrl+v                Attach            ctrl+o     Copy last response
                        clipboard         ctrl+c     Interrupt or quit
                        image             ctrl+z     Suspend Ash

  Transcript
  PageUp / PageDown     Scroll
                        transcript
  Ctrl+Home / Ctrl+End  Oldest /
                        latest
  Ctrl+↑ / Ctrl+↓       Select a
                        message

  ↑/↓ scroll · Esc to close
